OL,3,ABrazilian authorities question
OL,4,Awhereabouts of Flavio Bolsonaro after
OL,5,Ahe fails to surrender passports
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Brazil say they have
OL,8,Fcancelled the passports of Flavio
OL,9,FBolsonaro after he failed to comply
OL,10,Fwith an order to surrender the
OL,11,Fdocuments - our correspondent explains
OL,12,Fwhat we know
OL,14,FReports from several media outlets
OL,15,Fsuggest that the presidential candidate
OL,16,Fhas travelled to the US
OL,18,FBolsonaro, who was defeated in the
OL,19,FBrazilian presidential election on
OL,20,FSunday, is under investigation for
OL,21,Falleged corruption and money
OL,22,Flaundering, which he denies
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
